OL,5,G1450 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FKent. Photographer Anthony plans
OL,7,     Fto impress his guests with
OL,8,     Fculinary excellence on the final
OL,9,     Fnight. Mark's on cheesy overdrive,
OL,10,     Fand Karen showcases some
OL,11,     Fincredible impressions. (Ep5/5)
OL,12,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe competition begins at The View
OL,14,     Fin Tynemouth, run by Graeme and
OL,15,     FBrenda. Their B&B has royal
OL,16,     Fhistory, but their guests don't
OL,17,     Fthink the shared bathrooms are
OL,18,     Fvery regal.
