OL,5,G2200 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThis episode explores freedom,
OL,7,     Findependence and renewal. David,
OL,8,     Fwho's 27, has fallen 40 feet from
OL,9,     Fa tree and landed head-first on
OL,10,     Fconcrete. Anne, who's 74, has
OL,11,     Fchest pains.
OL,12,G2305 999: On the Front Line
